SolAttn-AMD
Copyright 2026 SolAttn-AMD contributors

This project implements the SOL-style routing and approximate correction
algorithm described by Haopeng Li et al. in arXiv:2607.24027 (2026).
The initial kernels and independent reference are new implementations.
No NVIDIA CuTe/CUDA kernel or comfy-kitchen HIP kernel is vendored here.

Related implementations consulted for comparison:
https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-SolAttn_triton
https://github.com/Comfy-Org/comfy-kitchen
